    text The card component comprises several elements that you can mix and match:
    text card danger
    text card-header danger
    text card-header-title: a left-aligned bold text
    text card-header-icon: a placeholder for an icon
    text card-image: a fullwidth container for a responsive image
    text card-content: a multi-purpose container for any other element
    text card-footer danger
    text card-footer-item: a repeatable list item
    text You can center the card-header-title by appending the is-centered modifier.
    text Example
    image https://bulma.io/assets/images/placeholders/1280x960.png "Placeholder image"
    row
      image https://bulma.io/assets/images/placeholders/96x96.png "Placeholder image"
      col
        text John Smith
        text @johnsmith
    link "#css" #
    link "#responsive" #
    text "11:09 PM - 1 Jan 2016"
    text HTML
    text "<div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"card-image\"> <figure class=\"image is-4by3\"> <img src=\"https://bulma.io/assets/images/placeholders/1280x960.png\" alt=\"Placeholder image\" /> </figure> </div> <div class=\"card-content\"> <div class=\"media\"> <div class=\"media-left\"> <figure class=\"image is-48x48\"> <img src=\"https://bulma.io/assets/images/placeholders/96x96.png\" alt=\"Placeholder image\" /> </figure> </div> <div class=\"media-content\"> <p class=\"title is-4\">John Smith</p> <p class=\"subtitle is-6\">@johnsmith</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"content\"> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus nec iaculis mauris. <a>@bulmaio</a>. <a href=\"#\">#css</a> <a href=\"#\">#responsive</a> <br /> <time datetime=\"2016-1-1\">11:09 PM - 1 Jan 2016</time> </div> </div> </div>"
    button Copy danger
    h3 "Card parts #"
    text The card-header can have a title and a Bulma icon:
    text Example
    row
      text Card header
      button "more options"
    text HTML
    text "<div class=\"card\"> <header class=\"card-header\"> <p class=\"card-header-title\">Card header</p> <button class=\"card-header-icon\" aria-label=\"more options\"> <span class=\"icon\"> <i class=\"fas fa-angle-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> </span> </button> </header> </div>"
    button Copy danger
    text The card-image is a container for a Bulma image element:
    text Example
    image https://bulma.io/assets/images/placeholders/1280x960.png "Placeholder image"
    text HTML
    text "<div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"card-image\"> <figure class=\"image is-4by3\"> <img src=\"https://bulma.io/assets/images/placeholders/1280x960.png\" alt=\"Placeholder image\" /> </figure> </div> </div>"
    button Copy danger
    text The card-content is the main part, ideal for text content, thanks to its padding:
    text Example
    text Lorem ipsum leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros. Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus. Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus. Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum.
    text HTML
    text "<div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"card-content\"> <div class=\"content\"> Lorem ipsum leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros. Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus. Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus. Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. </div> </div> </div>"
    button Copy danger
    text The card-footer acts as a list of for several card-footer-item elements:
    text Example
    card
